SUMMARY:Lighting of the Tree in Mardi Gras Park
DESCRIPTION:The City of Mobile lights its Christmas tree in Mardi Gras Par
 k on Friday\, November 20\, from 5:30 PM to 8:00 PM. Mobile Ballet and a 
 holiday opera performance open the night\, Santa arrives at 6:00 PM\, and
  the mayor lights the tree at 6:20 PM. Local vendors\, food trucks\, holi
 day crafts\, games and inflatables are on site\, and a drone show closes 
 the evening at 7:00 PM. Outdoor events can change with the weather.\nPric
 e: Free\nArea: Mobile & Baldwin County\nTimes: Friday 11/20 · 5:30 PM\nC
 hecked against the venue's own page on 2026-11-04\nhttps://coastaleventur
 es.com/events/ev-mobile-lighting-of-the-tree-1120.html
